Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:06:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] cxgb4: rework fw_caps_to_lmm() and lmm_to_fw_caps()

Rework fw_caps_to_lmm() to use the port medium instead of individual port
types. Add medium-based handling for KR, CR, SR, LR, DR, LRM, TP and NONE,
with speed capabilities derived from firmware-reported speeds.
---
